window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Tick, tick, tock. </p><p>Time. That's all I have now. A small room, a photograph, and time. They want me to trust them and confess my sins. They told me they wouldn't judge me - they lied. </p><p>I thought we could convince the world that this wasn't a crime. We were wrong. </p><p>Time doesn't stand still. The clock keeps ticking, the world is unconvinced, and now… Now he is gone.</p>"; 
